<p>Textures in DAO are stored in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/DDS" title="DDS">DDS</a> format. Native support of this file type can be added to a graphics package such as Adobe Photoshop or GIMP via the use of plugins. Alternatively, a DDS can be converted into a more universal format such as TGA or JPG using 3rd party tools.
</p>
